sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Hire and review staff
    %% Stories: 27, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 33
    %% Description: The manager hires new employees, an applicant registers an account and the manager is notified. The manager reviews employees, their contracts and certificates.
    actor MP as Manager (person)
    actor AP as Applicant
    participant MG as Manager
    participant E as Employee
    participant CT as Contract
    participant CF as Certificate

    %% covers 27
    MP->>MG: hire new employee
    MG->>E: new employee
    %% covers 31
    AP->>E: register account
    %% covers 28
    E->>MG: notify of completed hiring
    %% covers 29, 30
    MP->>MG: view active and absent employees
    MG->>E: employees
    %% covers 32, 33
    MP->>MG: view contracts and certificates
    MG->>E: employee
    E->>CT: contracts
    E->>CF: certificates
